 "sentences": [
  "This Confederate regiment lasted only months!",
  "The 4th Missouri Infantry Regiment formed on April 28, 1862.",
  "It missed action at Farmington and Iuka despite being present.",
  "The men charged Union lines three times during the Second Battle of Corinth.",
  "An attack on October 4 was repulsed by a Union counterattack.",
  "On November 7, 1862, it combined with the 1st Missouri Infantry Regiment."
